  "description": "Succeeded by the Longshot Flare (Gen2).\n\nThe first generation Flare was our 27.5\" short-travel trail bike. It combined the DNA of our Rocket enduro bike with the light, subtle feel of our legendary Soul to bring a fun, nippy, endlessly addictive ride. 27.5\" wheels kept the weight low and the handling agile and responsive.\n\nThe Flare balanced light weight with toughness: a singletrack scalpel one minute, a rock-smashing bomber the next, and one of the most versatile bikes we've made. If you loved our hardtails, this was the full suspension bike for you. Fleet-footed, quick handling, crisp climbing and fun descending: in short, what we used to call a \"mountain bike\".\n\nSizes: Small, Medium and Large. Wheels: 27.5\". Rear travel: 130mm.",
